{"unit_id":"1225Sakura__oh-my-deepseekharness#readme-1","repo":"1225Sakura/oh-my-deepseekharness","commit":"40ca05c5611511d6872d165267917414c5e4e255","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@sakura12/oh-my-deepseekharness README · oh-my-dsh (omd)：[](./LICENSE) [](https://nodejs.org/) [](./tests)\n\n**DeepSeek Harness 的多智能体编排层** —— OMC / OMX 编排理念的 dsh 宿主适配实现。\nMulti-agent orchestration layer for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness), adapted from:\n\n- [oh-my-claudecode (OMC)](https://github.com/Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-claudecode) — Claude Code 编排层\n- [oh-my-codex (OMX)](https://github.com/Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-codex) — Codex 编排层","source":"extracted","section":"oh-my-dsh (omd)"}
{"unit_id":"1225Sakura__oh-my-deepseekharness#readme-2","repo":"1225Sakura/oh-my-deepseekharness","commit":"40ca05c5611511d6872d165267917414c5e4e255","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@sakura12/oh-my-deepseekharness README · oh-my-dsh (omd)：omd 以单个 dsh 插件交付：注入编排协议到系统提示词、注册 49 个 skill 目录 + 33 个 `omd-agent-*` 角色卡（66 个双语文件，会话技能目录共 82 条）与 3 个斜杠命令、挂载内置 MCP server 提供 58 个状态/记忆/协调/代码智能/graph 运行时工具。三种执行模式（autopilot / ralph / team）：autopilot 与 ralph 由 dsh 原生 `goal` / `ralph` 工具驱动前台循环；team 由 `lib/team.js` 领队运行时驱动（阶段状态机 + 队员 UUID 生命周期 + mailbox + heartbeat + merge 计划，无 tmux——dsh 无承载面）。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"oh-my-dsh (omd)"}
