{"unit_id":"1225Sakura__oh-my-deepseekharness#readme-14","repo":"1225Sakura/oh-my-deepseekharness","commit":"40ca05c5611511d6872d165267917414c5e4e255","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@sakura12/oh-my-deepseekharness README · <profile 目录>/cordis.patch.yml（追加一条；文件里已有其他插件条目则并列）：- id: oh-my-dsh\n  config:\n    language: zh\n    tiers:\n      low: inherit          # 继承主会话\n      high: deepseek-reasoner\n    roleOverrides:\n      omd-agent-verifier: deepseek/deepseek-reasoner\n    autopilot:\n      maxIterations: 15\n    team:\n      heartbeatIntervalMs: 60000\n    codeIntel:\n      lspServers:\n        typescript:\n          command: typescript-language-server\n          args: [\"--stdio\"]\n          languages: [typescript]\n```","source":"extracted","section":"<profile 目录>/cordis.patch.yml（追加一条；文件里已有其他插件条目则并列）"}
{"unit_id":"1225Sakura__oh-my-deepseekharness#readme-15","repo":"1225Sakura/oh-my-deepseekharness","commit":"40ca05c5611511d6872d165267917414c5e4e255","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@sakura12/oh-my-deepseekharness README · 「stale」阈值总表（同一术语三处语义，一处可查）：| 面 | 阈值 | 配置键 | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| team 队员心跳 | 5 分钟 | `team.staleAfterMs` | 队员超阈值无心跳 → stale（检测+呈面，绝不自动杀） |\n| 模式状态（ralph/autopilot 等非 team） | 2 小时 | 无（规格 §5.4 定值） | 状态文件超阈值未更新 → HUD/协议判 stale（只报告不自动续跑） |\n| graph run 停滞 | 10 分钟 | `graph.stalledAfterMs` | journal 超阈值未推进且有等待节点 → HUD 告警行 |","source":"extracted","section":"「stale」阈值总表（同一术语三处语义，一处可查）"}
{"unit_id":"1225Sakura__oh-my-deepseekharness#readme-16","repo":"1225Sakura/oh-my-deepseekharness","commit":"40ca05c5611511d6872d165267917414c5e4e255","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@sakura12/oh-my-deepseekharness README · 迁移说明 / Migration（0.4.4 → 0.4.5 行为变更）：**`tiers` 三档默认值从写死的 `glm-5.3-flash` 改为 `'inherit'`（继承主会话模型路由）**。影响面：\n\n- 已显式配置 `tiers` 或经 `roleOverrides` 覆盖的部署：**不受影响**；\n- 经 `omd_delegate` 显式指定 `model` 的派发：**不受影响**（显式 model 绕过档位表，一等硬指定）；\n- 未做任何配置的部署：档位派发从「固定 glm-5.3-flash」变为「继承主会话模型」——成本敏感部署（希望档位派发继续走指定小模型）应在 Config 中把 `tiers.<tier>` 显式写回具体模型 id。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"迁移说明 / Migration（0.4.4 → 0.4.5 行为变更）"}
{"unit_id":"1225Sakura__oh-my-deepseekharness#readme-17","repo":"1225Sakura/oh-my-deepseekharness","commit":"40ca05c5611511d6872d165267917414c5e4e255","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@sakura12/oh-my-deepseekharness README · 状态目录 / `.omd/` Layout：所有模式状态落在项目目录的 `.omd/`（可用 `stateDir` 改名），取消/崩溃后可恢复：\n\n```\n.omd/\n├── state/\n│   ├── sessions/<sessionId>/<mode>-state.json   # 每会话每模式状态（active/phase/iteration）\n│   ├── run-state.json                           # c6 七字段镜像（CAS，队长独占写）\n\n> `.omd/` 是运行时产物，建议加入 `.gitignore`。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"状态目录 / `.omd/` Layout"}
{"unit_id":"1225Sakura__oh-my-deepseekharness#readme-18","repo":"1225Sakura/oh-my-deepseekharness","commit":"40ca05c5611511d6872d165267917414c5e4e255","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@sakura12/oh-my-deepseekharness README · 降级与依赖边界 / Graceful Degradation：- **零第三方 dsh 插件依赖**：不依赖任何非 `@deepseek-ai/*` 官方插件。\n- 启动时能力探测与注册结果汇总渲染进系统提示词的能力矩阵（其中 core/storage 两项由 probe.js 实测探测；skills/mcpServer/delegate/keywordHook/teamHeartbeat/hudRoute/codeIntel/memoryTools/commands 九项为 apply 注册结果的追加记录——「注册成功」不等于「探测通过」），降级时协议指导模型走文件直读兜底：\n  - 核心 inject 服务（tools/skills/systemPrompt/commands）缺失 → 插件启动即报错（唯一硬依赖）；\n  - `storage` 缺失 → 记忆工具不注册；\n  - MCP server 挂载失败 → `state_*`/`notepad_*`/`prd_*`/`handoff_*`/`team_*`/`trace_*`/`hud_*`/`graph_*` 不可用，协议降级为直接读写 `.omd/` 文件；\n  - `@ast-grep/napi` 缺失 → `ast_grep_*` 显式报错（probe 记 `codeIntel: unavailable`），LSP 不受影响；\n  - `webServer` 缺席（CLI 会话）→ HUD 数据路由不注册（probe 记 `hudRoute: skipped`，MCP `hud_render` 同款可用）；\n  - 运行 `/omd-doctor` 可随时查看当前降级状态。\n- **graph 运行时授权面（已知暴露面登记）**：descriptor 内 command 节点是经 pwsh 执行的任意 shell 行，`bin/graph-runner.mjs` 与 MCP `graph_run` 同权——只运行你撰写或信任的 descriptor。MVP 阶段为声明式信任（无 allowlist/沙箱），登记于 docs/code-quality-logic-review.md 安全节。","source":"extracted","section":"降级与依赖边界 / Graceful Degradation"}
{"unit_id":"1225Sakura__oh-my-deepseekharness#readme-20","repo":"1225Sakura/oh-my-deepseekharness","commit":"40ca05c5611511d6872d165267917414c5e4e255","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@sakura12/oh-my-deepseekharness README · 开发 / Development：```bash\nnpm test            # vitest 全量（53 files / 652 tests）\nnpm run test:watch\n```\n\n`lib/client.js`（HUD client half）是**手工维护的懒加载 CJS bundle**（无构建步骤），格式经 `tests/lib/client-bundle.test.js` 沙箱断言；dsh web 宿主需重启以装载/更新 client 插件。\n\n上游快照约定：`reference/`（gitignored 本机快照）升级 OMC/OMX 版本后，必须同轮更新 `docs/upstream-form-*.md` 形态卡与 `docs/feature-parity-audit.md`，并跑 `npm test -- upstream-forms` 守门（两层门：仓内一致性恒跑；reference 缺席环境漂移层 skip 属预期）。","source":"extracted","section":"开发 / Development"}
